║                                                                              ║
║  Recording Instructions:                                                     ║
║  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────    ║
║  1. Install asciinema: pip install asciinema                                 ║
║  2. Record session: asciinema rec demo.cast                                  ║
║  3. Run demo: python examples/demo_simple.py --mock                          ║
║  4. Convert to GIF: agg demo.cast docs/assets/demo.gif                       ║
║                                                                              ║
║  Or use the demo walkthrough: cd examples/demo-walkthrough && ./record.sh    ║
║                                                                              ║
╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
