║  • Initial alert triage and severity assessment                              ║
║  • Multi-source evidence gathering (K8s, Prometheus, logs)                   ║
║  • AI-powered hypothesis generation and testing                              ║
║  • Confidence-scored root cause identification                               ║
║  • Human-in-the-loop approval for remediation actions                        ║
║  • Memory recall of similar past incidents                                   ║
